			dependencies: ["4D2FD4E06FA72C31"]
			description: [
				"Obtainable by completing The Queen's Desire advancements you get from the &6Bee Queen&r as each advancement will give one &eRoyal Jelly Bottle&r. The advancements unlock when you first trade with the &6Bee Queen&r. When you finished all the The Queen's Desire advancements, you can double right click the &6Bee Queen&r to reset this advancement line to repeat for more &eRoyal Jelly Bottles&r!"
